domain.
conflicts: none
open gaps: none
`NEEDS_ATTENTION` is a steady successful state
for an unverified DKIM: OCI has created the key
and is waiting for the operator to publish its
DNS records. The runtime must not fail
reconciliation while that external DNS action is
pending.
`CREATING` and `UPDATING` requeue; `ACTIVE` and
`NEEDS_ATTENTION` are successful steady states;
delete retains the finalizer through `DELETING`
until OCI reports `DELETED` or an unambiguous
absence.
The runtime projects the generated selector and
DNS CNAME/TXT values into status without
creating Kubernetes Secrets.
end note
